      "uid": "zhcn:4f03efefc2eac2a6e704a0c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上传视频前稍微跑了一下，\n腿脚比上周轻盈多了……大概是\n多亏了你的Love吧。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ccb9f1b8f0b90a560d317bef44b807baa892ec9d426a4ab47fcd648592496b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
