      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4c74826e81872957f034eb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……稍微，稍微多一点，\n你的Love，可以让我比平时\n得到更多一点吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "90fa766048b557ca5331277387e533e9f645889c2743e7ad003d8d4acfcfd590",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b9f8b5111e09f33a367021f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在，存在于我心中的是大家的爱\n和你的爱。至于这些爱有多少……\n就让我来展现给你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12bc51f2c064df560a085f4b68aa0d2a28b33ccc9d6172e34eaf1d5e9ae4c749",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b667c50fef97e0ee19ae791",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天又要再证明一次了呢。\n你就是我通往梦想的“桥梁”♪",
