      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f4bce504ad3a782bc7db58c1c3bf690d86ff33e4ad95b0ec3aed85c79ec42e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14d938119cf779b6e4cbd2b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "起床后社区民发来了\n很多“早上好”的留言♪\n嗯，今天也会是美好的一天呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae939613fb27adfbfff1429a39fe80eb606d4b6143d5b41718a384648973f5aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:280045ddaebdae8fa667e52e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯~~！早上的直播很开心！\n看到的大家的评论后，\n要上喽！就会像这样情绪高涨呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a96e2f229bd94584e57291156be0447a9c1ce9c29064c3c8066e3b2eee726f27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1399e27c86600ec900c524e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新买的曲奇很好吃，\n我打算研究一下它的食谱。\n想让社区民也尝尝呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3ce813aa0920d0f5887b84786826157d6ddf09f8b48212b6780b768ebb4c457",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:841fb322d4c84e1149356505",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最喜欢食堂的菜品了！\n不仅营养平衡，调味还不腻，\n很能感受到其中的爱呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "684b80be991566ef880bdbc2b9959cc92df78a9842d9b40c15af5b4986b26580",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f999d285e37aacd7154df1e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小金花为我做了香氛，\n因此每天晚上睡得可香了，\n温柔的香味能让我熟睡到天亮♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "44aba3e9ae5517a6d1d67cd4e6310d22b7de0672593e5782f829e142878ed4f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea2c58b6e772f29566a1f619",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家在直播中告诉了我\n今天吃的晚饭，虽然是很开心……\n就是让我饿得不行了呢~",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c7ca7ed0c08ae4bad86a3cecee8abc0b6a970c643786ff23f9fcc9ccb6def29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d765a9729fa465a05cc2c84c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "母鸟会拼命地给\n宿舍院子里出生的雏鸟喂食。\n这无偿的爱，眼睛都要湿润了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6889dca9c1a4325465a56b9015f8fb3a64115214ec03d1d3b5dcbba8d8cdd280",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:517e6f02bde353a37599b9cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的电脑一响，小创就会默默地\n把空调开大以便我集中精力编辑。\n真是帮大忙了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc7e9c91b909e5a0865db9e5561a8a159db8d882648a14af4bd18c2e2a5dde3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff4361fb6e306890069ff990",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红叶总有一天会凋谢。但是，\n直播时和大家一起看到的回忆\n会留存在文件夹和心中……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bba293e1b8bf69329747e6c2c38f3600074a4a4918c2faa3ee56f50be205c9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05d5005aa20aa7cc86677366",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做的雪人，刺刺的很帅哦！\n亮点是像海胆一样的肩膀♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f53a7d0faa3182cc0f8963827f6e2e6ddf1f376dd0e6501688e056bc934cacfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:891961ac8e55f450957d6227",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "408658afda9ff06100155e80e05e1e7a92a57aabd76c04f8bab3f2e48bd658d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:135470b16291af1f21d3e473",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小创一谈到赛跑史就很热情，\n我很喜欢呢！\n那闪闪发光的眼睛…正是爱啊♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "a43208adc7a4678802302284c51635ea6f9b327699788bba70ec75839644340a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d85dcbc6b29e1a8caaaa6c86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小欢呼的My rule，\n教给我的都试过了。\n了解对手也是一种爱呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "728b49b96f7cc5e15cb2fb578b805f5afc3a04740cb60cce5bef1177bc7d774b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ef96869fccda640872ed384",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小金花给我做了能在LANE上使用的\n小花花贴图！实在太可爱了。\n让人想不停的戳戳戳呢～♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "676eb2ba8c21801e2c3198b89ed6693d264304fede23c806d3938bf63972f40b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20d366c35ca1b3abc1176221",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候的我可是个疯丫头呢。\n每张照片都是满身的泥……呵呵。\n要不然休息时回归一下童心吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "613e479f6705c209652277b7a4aade3892899cb4cfc54a8f22d75489a91a1af8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c3bb8f33bbddc6d5fa1a1b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次直播后，爸爸妈妈都会告诉我\n感想。即使分开也不会寂寞……\n因为有爱将我们相连♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3cdad92aa966cc5225c446fc1029cb3e773748327ba56140bce68bc9df31d4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86f23e797fe9f28bcef2e83e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live结束后很期待看到\n粉丝们的留言。\n大家的喜悦就是我的能量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c909bb42380d9590f55cf025ab31e70aa88d22af2da1832760720c1173ac3e72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7560a9917d1ae44a5ca50b27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备……爱心射线♡\n这个姿势最重要的是视线。\n就算是画面的另一侧也会被击穿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd76f2f46003df41513a6f794eb3397bdf0f79b6fc384ded4e9d78574c9f5d5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f5561c609c7f5d9af4b9e8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣服社区民也一起参与了设计。\n背负着大家的爱，\n毫无疑问要拿下第一名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edc656be693c7bd35f880ac32b091f1db963f9cbd6152d9009ed4fc3a1475e88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:385bfdbd86f61feec0fa0756",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我身上有多少颗爱心呢？\n……正确答案是衣服上有26个，\n再加上心里的一大堆♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "c745682fdde4799d432c04103bfe3194aba78055b90a51c0627ac002bd12ecf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66ee316d16d2ec064394b74b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，从早上开始就很精神呢。\n为了不造成负担，\n看来昨晚的早下播是正确选择♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ba3dc29e8bceb13a695f4eb0e206748c76e7dad0074941535b8d60dc55d6cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e97066cb1c6394f54e961e0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午饭以沙拉为主之后，\n状态就变得很好了。\n小欢呼的优点，我会多多学习的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cf24fc161ecf52e3fdcec527025676f7cb09293407a5edd1d8f210cfb4cd443",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa0d6c625bfc4482db976c0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给沉迷于读书的小创吹头发\n是我的日常。托她的福，\n吹风机也用得更熟练了，呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "020e4ae6682cd8d69c8867c357647497aebe0034cd49a2de5da7d0eabfc7e600",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c16dbc97624d43a4d73c0e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候和青梅竹马发现的赏花场所\n是只属于两个人的秘密。\n也是只属于我们的爱♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd60f24f3d41bfe38a44741c05271ee31dd33e5c525495f7ea695f2b110d1a48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64ed4df2a86b7ca15a1e8bc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去吃树莓冰淇淋吧！\n就是直播时说过的那家店。\n是酸酸甜甜的爱呢～♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02e0af0297211710d989ed5ba4a07423c7f422f1d6b696273165ab81853cb13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2947b34977c9b920cc9afb30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "品尝秋之味觉的巡礼真是享受啊！\n但为了不影响比赛，\n必须得严格自律才行…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14448bc408aaca3ccbc591fdfdbfd0d229137cba4e72d9fc50e4afe7668b85b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8733479dad3624a378fd547d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，今天可是长时间直播哦！\n中途睡倒也OK，我和观众都会\n捧着热可可开启暖呼呼的杂谈时光♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "02e21a683996e833a8f216a3efd423355d158c3048fe093bcdae8d027bd2caa3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aebd38117fa93aa06626bcb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要直播一下训练吗？\n我的努力要是能成为大家的活力\n那就太棒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77d377c02caed2354b1414ab8f559f29c0a742a9e5185227059c4f669a8dbd9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:093e5c29bef6c206e84a488e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有温柔的话不能算爱。\n要不断地获胜……在和大家分享爱\n的那天到来之前，不需要客气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f216c23c3cb240ebd4b9aa17ccaf2be9cb1b2285f6b0f8d39e1177b9d7aa1a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a84099159aec715069c394f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天就用我的相机来拍摄造型吧。\n就用我引以为傲的美丽影像，\n来彻底剖析课题！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca50af96ae473ce3541fd53a7b47624b7720affa8ec5ff199a2c36b42e14696",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87105fe39015390183cb5e05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看起来很累呢……对了！\n要不你也来做一下伸展运动吧？\n一起的话，精神也会倍增哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d652c070824da6f91eec73f9e86b59b55406a6f7aee7895bcb5159beff7eee62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:728ed6e7864148dc430bfefe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的爱是必要的。\n为了更多地把爱扩散出去，\n助我一臂之力吧，训练员君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5db988fe8ed813438131923d8d60c06690e8fb0b05d045a0d2530ab5b927db67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f349a6c879803763589bfa91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学到的东西会将结果联系起来。\n那就是用我的爱来回报你的爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c710e9654bd12193c41b956938ddbf999e6fe63bce277426d0bbd25955c128b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad2dac0d8a9eb7bf682e9a00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，两人相连的爱之轮\n包围世界的瞬间，我都等不及了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fff3bee9e819f6c8425b819951a1c924a89649a626f1684d2a3df7bd97ff02b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92007"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
